#: Sources/Gui/UI/Settings/PreferencePanels.cpp:179
msgctxt "Preferences"
msgid ""
"Draws a visual indicator of the current weapon's spread cone. Useful for "
"understanding accuracy while moving, jumping, or aiming."
msgstr ""
"Dibuja un indicador visual del cono de dispersión del arma actual. Es útil "
"para comprender la precisión al moverse, saltar o apuntar."

