#: Sources/Gui/UI/StartupScreen/ConfigViewTabs.cpp:82
msgctxt "StartupScreen"
msgid ""
"By running in fullscreen mode OpenSpades occupies the screen, making it "
"easier for you to concentrate on playing the game."
msgstr ""
"Al ejecutarse en modo de pantalla completa, OpenSpades ocupa toda la "
"pantalla, lo que te permite concentrarte mejor en el juego."

#: Sources/Gui/UI/StartupScreen/ConfigViewTabs.cpp:90
